Origin and Derivative Status
----------------------------

The PTP/IP connection concept and the camera-gallery interaction model in this
project were informed by the open repository:

    https://github.com/yyhhzzzzz/Nikon_connect

That repository is an iOS (Swift/SwiftUI) application. It is published without
an explicit open-source license; under copyright law, "all rights reserved"
applies by default. This Android project does **not** include, copy, or
redistribute the iOS source code from that repository. It is an independent
implementation of the PTP/IP protocol for Android, written from scratch.

